CRIT Rate and a Burst-triggered ATK team buff. Primarily a stat stick; its passive is less valuable for DEF-scaling Zibai."},{"name":"Peak Patrol Song","text":"Large DEF% stat and team Elemental DMG buffs after Normal/Plunging Attack hits."},{"name":"Flute of Ezpitzal","text":"Craftable DEF sword with more DEF after Skill. Excellent F2P choice for Zibai."},{"name":"Cinnabar Spindle","text":"DEF% weapon that adds damage to Skill hits based on DEF; past-event only."},{"name":"Harbinger of Dawn","text":"Strong CRIT option while HP stays above 90%. A shielder or reliable healing helps maintain its passive."}],"a":[{"names":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"text":"Best Lunar set: EM, conditional CRIT Rate and a team Lunar damage bonus at Ascendant Gleam.","stats":"DEF% · DEF% · CR/CD"},{"names":["Husk of Opulent Dreams"],"text":"DEF and Geo DMG help as a temporary set, but it trails Night of the Sky’s Unveiling.","stats":"DEF% · DEF% · CR/CD"},{"names":["Husk of Opulent Dreams","Wanderer's Troupe"],"text":"Use 2pc DEF with 2pc EM while farming Night of the Sky’s Unveiling.","stats":"DEF% · DEF% · CR/CD"}],"t":[{"name":"Crater Expectations","members":["Zibai","Illuga","Columbina","Linnea"],"text":"Zibai leads on-field Lunar-Crystallize damage, Columbina provides off-field Hydro and Lunar buffs, Linnea adds Geo RES shred, healing, and EM buffs, and Illuga boosts Geo and Lunar-Crystallize damage.","roles":["DPS","Support","Hydro Support","Sub DPS"]},{"name":"Geo Force One","members":["Zibai","Illuga","Columbina","Gorou"],"text":"Zibai leads on-field Lunar-Crystallize damage, Columbina provides off-field Hydro and Lunar buffs, Illuga boosts Geo and Lunar-Crystallize damage, and Gorou adds DEF and Geo DMG buffs.","roles":["On-field DPS","Geo Buffer","Off-field DPS / Buffer","DEF Buffer"]},{"name":"OSMANTHUS WHINES","members":["Zibai","Illuga","Columbina","Zhongli"],"text":"Zibai leads on-field Lunar-Crystallize damage, Columbina provides off-field Hydro and Lunar buffs, Illuga boosts Geo and Lunar-Crystallize damage, and Zhongli provides shielding and universal RES shred.","roles":["On-field DPS","Geo Buffer","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Shielder / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Columbina at Home","members":["Zibai","Illuga","Aino","Gorou"],"text":"Zibai leads on-field Lunar-Crystallize damage, Illuga provides major Geo and Lunar reaction buffs, Aino supplies off-field Hydro application, and Gorou boosts DEF and Geo damage.","roles":["On-field DPS","Geo Buffer","Off-field DPS / Enabler","DEF Buffer"]}],"v":"Lunar-Crystallize DPS: Stay on-field during Skill to deal direct Lunar-Crystallize damage.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["DPS"],"about":"Zibai is a Geo on-field DPS focused on Lunar-Crystallize, offering strong sustained damage but favoring dedicated team setups. Also, she's a horse.","pros":["Strong sustained DMG","Excellent Lunar synergy","Great AoE coverage","Strong investment scaling"],"cons":["Team restrictive","Wants specific supports","Reaction dependent","Lower team flexibility"],"weapons":["Lightbearing Moonshard","Uraku Misugiri","Light of Foliar Incision","Athame Artis","Peak Patrol Song","Flute of Ezpitzal","Cinnabar Spindle","Harbinger of Dawn"],"arts":[{"sets":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Husk of Opulent Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Husk of Opulent Dreams","Wanderer's Troupe"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Temporary mixed set"}],"main":["DEF%","DEF%","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["DEF: 2,500+","CRIT Rate: 40–50% with Night of the Sky’s Unveiling","CRIT DMG: 170–200%+","Energy Recharge: 110–130%"],"vars":[{"title":"Lunar-Crystallize DPS","role":"Main DPS","weapons":["Lightbearing Moonshard","Uraku Misugiri"],"arts":[{"sets":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"DEF% / DEF% / CRIT; build around set CRIT Rate.","teams":"Geo and Hydro teammates with Ascendant Gleam.","when":"Stay on-field during Skill to deal direct Lunar-Crystallize damage.","cond":"","n